
$TTL         1M
$ORIGIN      example.org.

@            IN  SOA    ns1.example.com. admin.example.com.  (
                               abc ; Serial - invalid
                               1200       ; Refresh
                               144        ; Retry
                               1814400    ; Expire
                               2h )       ; Minimum
@            IN  NS     ns1.example.com.

www          IN  A      192.168.0.14
